# detail
Number of changes: 2

1. Added | Conditional statement
   Added handling for `trans == 'passthrough'`, followed by `continue`.
   This includes:
   * Conditional statement: test whether `self._df_columns` exists;
   * Conditional statement: test whether `column` is not a `slice` and whether all its elements are strings;
   * Method calls: append `column`, `self._df_columns[column]`, or a list of feature names generated by index to `feature_names`;
   * Assignment statement: assign `np.arange(self._n_features)` to `indices`;
   * Control-flow statement: execute `continue`.

2. Modified | Conditional statement
   Changed `elif not hasattr(trans, 'get_feature_names')` to an independent `if not hasattr(trans, 'get_feature_names')` statement.
# /detail
